                                        "entry_id": "51b4ca04-4dd2-3897-8ec2-34a3f95c7b80",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To adopt the obelisk posture; to point the tip of the abdomen towards the sun."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a dragonfly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
